  "resume": "This is a Swiss TV news report from the Tagesschau broadcast on 17 January 1958, showing pleasant winter weather in Lugano, Ticino. It features footage of people strolling along the lakefront, sitting at a street café, and a man in a bathrobe jumping into the cold water to swim. The segment focuses on local weather and leisure activities."
